  "description": "So-un Jin, a third-rate martial artist with an exceptional memory, awakens 30 years in the past, just before the return of the Demonic Cult. He's been given a second chance, but that's where divine intervention ends. With no innate talent for martial arts, no legendary master to guide him, and only a small, powerless sect to call home, his future seems just as bleak as before. Can So-un use his knowledge of the future to change the course of fate? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
